From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 08:17:57 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 036/118] urltest: take the download test URL from the group's
 download_url

The download test URL came only from SING_BOX_URLTEST_DOWNLOAD_URL, one for every
group. The urltest option download_url sets it per group, the way VLESS reads
packet_encoding: absent, the environment variable is taken as before; empty,
the test is off for the group; a URL, the test uses it. A value the test could
not use (no http/https scheme, no host) is a configuration error that sing-box
check reports, where a bad environment value only logs at every selection.
